## Test your Russian
lang: en

Two minutes or ten, depending on how much Russian you already know.
    text line "Every right answer tells the course what you can skip." x 500 y 625 font_size 26

Pass a part, and the course marks those ten lessons as ones you can skip.

First, where are you with Russian? Tap the one that fits.
    box lvl_new "Brand new" x 140 y 400 width 210 height 120 radius 12 font_size 26
    box lvl_letters "I read letters" x 380 y 400 width 210 height 120 radius 12 font_size 26
    box lvl_basics "Some basics" x 620 y 400 width 210 height 120 radius 12 font_size 26
    box lvl_talk "I can chat" x 860 y 400 width 210 height 120 radius 12 font_size 26

    ask "Where are you with Russian? Tap the box that fits you best." choose [{"id":"lvl_new","goto":"finish"},"lvl_letters","lvl_basics","lvl_talk"] judge false then warmup

@warmup

    erase line lvl_new lvl_letters lvl_basics lvl_talk

A quick warm-up. Do you know these words? Be honest: three of them are made up.

    flashcards cards [{"front":"понеде́льник","teaches":"vocabulary/days-of-week"},{"front":"хлеб","teaches":"vocabulary/food-and-drink"},{"front":"сестра́","teaches":"vocabulary/family"},{"front":"крупе́ль","fake":true},{"front":"пого́да","teaches":"vocabulary/weather"},{"front":"по́езд","teaches":"vocabulary/travel"},{"front":"мова́лка","fake":true},{"front":"ве́чером","teaches":"vocabulary/times-of-day"},{"front":"столи́ца","teaches":"vocabulary/places-in-town"},{"front":"пере́шна","fake":true}] mode yesno test w

    results test w

@s1

Part 1: lessons one to ten.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 1-10 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"Which hello is polite, for a teacher? Pick one.","choices":["приве́т","здра́вствуйте","пока́"],"correct":2},"teaches":"phrases/greetings"},{"quiz":{"question":"Which one says goodbye to a friend? Pick one.","choices":["спаси́бо","приве́т","пока́"],"correct":3},"teaches":"phrases/greetings"},{"quiz":{"question":"Где кни́га? The book is on the table. Pick one.","choices":["Кни́га на столе́.","Кни́га на стол.","Кни́га в стол."],"correct":1},"teaches":["phrases/where-is-it","grammar/place-ending"]},{"quiz":{"question":"Which word is feminine, она? Pick one.","choices":["стол","окно́","ла́мпа"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/gender"},{"quiz":{"question":"Read it: which word means restaurant? Pick one.","choices":["теа́тр","рестора́н","телефо́н"],"correct":2},"teaches":"reading/cyrillic-letters"}] count 8 test s1

    results test s1 pass 7 lectures 1-10

    if var s1.missed gte 3 goto finish

@s2

Part 2: lessons eleven to twenty.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 11-20 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"Which day comes after пя́тница? Pick one.","choices":["четве́рг","суббо́та","воскресе́нье"],"correct":2},"teaches":"vocabulary/days-of-week"},{"quiz":{"question":"Which one is 47? Pick one.","choices":["семна́дцать","се́мьдесят четы́ре","со́рок семь"],"correct":3},"teaches":"vocabulary/numbers-to-100"},{"quiz":{"question":"Masha says she was at the cinema: Я … в кино́. Pick one.","choices":["была́","был","бы́ло"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/past-tense"},{"quiz":{"question":"I see Masha: Я ви́жу … Pick one.","choices":["Ма́ша","Ма́ше","Ма́шу"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/object-ending"},{"ask":{"question":"One кни́га, two or more … Type the plural.","answer":["КНИГИ"],"keys":"АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ"},"teaches":"grammar/plurals"}] count 8 test s2

    results test s2 pass 7 lectures 11-20

    if var s2.missed gte 3 goto finish

@s3

Part 3: lessons twenty-one to thirty.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 21-30 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"It's three o'clock: Сейча́с три … Pick one.","choices":["часа́","часо́в","час"],"correct":1},"teaches":"phrases/telling-time"},{"quiz":{"question":"I have a brother: … есть брат. Pick one.","choices":["Мне","У меня́","Я"],"correct":2},"teaches":"phrases/having"},{"quiz":{"question":"He is twenty-one: Ему́ два́дцать оди́н … Pick one.","choices":["лет","го́да","год"],"correct":3},"teaches":["phrases/telling-age","grammar/counting-nouns"]},{"quiz":{"question":"Where are you going? … ты идёшь? Pick one.","choices":["Куда́","Где","Когда́"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/verbs-of-motion"},{"quiz":{"question":"I have no milk: У меня́ нет … Pick one.","choices":["молоко́","молока́","молоку́"],"correct":2},"teaches":"grammar/of-ending"}] count 8 test s3

    results test s3 pass 7 lectures 21-30

    if var s3.missed gte 3 goto finish

@s4

Part 4: lessons thirty-one to forty.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 31-40 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"Tomorrow I will work: За́втра я … рабо́тать. Pick one.","choices":["был","бу́дешь","бу́ду"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/future-tense"},{"quiz":{"question":"It's cold today: Сего́дня … Pick one.","choices":["хо́лодно","тепло́","жа́рко"],"correct":1},"teaches":"vocabulary/weather"},{"quiz":{"question":"Tea with lemon: чай с … Pick one.","choices":["лимо́н","лимо́ном","лимо́на"],"correct":2},"teaches":"grammar/with-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"I need to go: Мне … идти́. Pick one.","choices":["могу́","хочу́","ну́жно"],"correct":3},"teaches":"phrases/can-and-must"},{"quiz":{"question":"My head hurts: У меня́ боли́т … Pick one.","choices":["голова́","го́лову","голово́й"],"correct":1},"teaches":"vocabulary/health"},{"quiz":{"question":"Which word means in the evening? Pick one.","choices":["у́тром","ве́чером","днём"],"correct":2},"teaches":"vocabulary/times-of-day"}] count 8 test s4

    results test s4 pass 7 lectures 31-40

    if var s4.missed gte 3 goto finish

@s5

Part 5: lessons forty-one to fifty.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 41-50 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"Moscow is bigger than Oslo: Москва́ … О́сло. Pick one.","choices":["ме́ньше","лу́чше","бо́льше"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/comparatives"},{"quiz":{"question":"I have read the whole book: Я … кни́гу. Pick one.","choices":["прочита́л","чита́л","чита́ю"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/aspect"},{"quiz":{"question":"Please say it again: … , пожа́луйста. Pick one.","choices":["Купи́те","Повтори́те","Покажи́те"],"correct":2},"teaches":["phrases/asking-to-repeat","grammar/requests"]},{"quiz":{"question":"Which word means to the right? Pick one.","choices":["нале́во","пря́мо","напра́во"],"correct":3},"teaches":"phrases/asking-directions"},{"quiz":{"question":"I'm going by train: Я е́ду на … Pick one.","choices":["по́езде","по́езд","по́езду"],"correct":1},"teaches":["vocabulary/travel","grammar/verbs-of-motion"]},{"quiz":{"question":"I play football: Я игра́ю в … Pick one.","choices":["футбо́ле","футбо́л","футбо́лом"],"correct":2},"teaches":"vocabulary/hobbies"}] count 8 test s5

    results test s5 pass 7 lectures 41-50

    if var s5.missed gte 3 goto finish

@s6

Part 6: lessons fifty-one to sixty.

    draw_questions from pool course russian-from-zero-by-hmelberg lectures 51-60 questions [{"quiz":{"question":"We talk about mum: Мы говори́м о … Pick one.","choices":["ма́му","ма́ма","ма́ме"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/place-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"Many books: мно́го … Pick one.","choices":["книг","кни́ги","кни́га"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/of-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"Which month is May? Pick one.","choices":["март","май","ию́нь"],"correct":2},"teaches":"vocabulary/months"},{"quiz":{"question":"The first of May: … ма́я. Pick one.","choices":["оди́н","пе́рвый","пе́рвое"],"correct":3},"teaches":"phrases/dates"},{"quiz":{"question":"I see my brother: Я ви́жу … Pick one.","choices":["бра́та","брат","бра́ту"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/object-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"She works as a doctor: Она́ рабо́тает … Pick one.","choices":["врач","врачо́м","врача́"],"correct":2},"teaches":"grammar/with-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"I'm calling my sister: Я звоню́ … Pick one.","choices":["сестру́","сестра́","сестре́"],"correct":3},"teaches":"grammar/to-ending"},{"quiz":{"question":"In a big house: в … до́ме. Pick one.","choices":["большо́м","большо́й","большо́го"],"correct":1},"teaches":"grammar/case-agreement"}] count 8 test s6

    results test s6 pass 7 lectures 51-60

    if var s6.missed gte 3 goto finish

You know the whole course. Six questions from beyond it.

    draw_questions questions [{"quiz":{"question":"If I had time, I would come: Е́сли бы у меня́ бы́ло вре́мя, я … пришёл. Pick one.","choices":["бу́ду","бы","был"],"correct":2}},{"quiz":{"question":"He has left, on foot: Он … Pick one.","choices":["ушёл","пришёл","вошёл"],"correct":1}},{"quiz":{"question":"Five people: пять … Pick one.","choices":["люде́й","челове́ка","челове́к"],"correct":3}},{"quiz":{"question":"I'm interested in music: Я интересу́юсь … Pick one.","choices":["му́зыку","му́зыкой","му́зыка"],"correct":2}},{"quiz":{"question":"The man who lives here: Челове́к, … живёт здесь. Pick one.","choices":["кото́рый","кото́рая","кото́рого"],"correct":1}},{"quiz":{"question":"I'm going to my friends' place: Я иду́ к … Pick one.","choices":["друзе́й","друзья́х","друзья́м"],"correct":3}},{"quiz":{"question":"Call me tomorrow! … мне за́втра! Pick one.","choices":["Звони́л","Позвони́","Позвоню́"],"correct":2}}] count 6 test s7

    results test s7 pass 5

@finish

That's the test.

## Your route
lang: en

Open the course and press Follow.
    text r1 "1. Open Russian from zero" x 500 y 520 font_size 34
    text r2 "2. Press Follow" x 500 y 430 font_size 34

The lessons you passed are marked to skip, and Next always takes you to the first one you still need.
    text r3 "3. Lessons you passed say Skip" x 500 y 340 font_size 34

You can keep any lesson you want, and take this test again whenever you like.

